    {
      "id": "claim_f96bf926f64a4691bc7753aef9a4a75d",
      "statement": "The build moved from Paketo's `bootBuildImage` to a plain Dockerfile because Docker 29's containerd-backed image store mis-derives layer diffIDs when exporting buildpack images, which strict pull-side verifiers like k3s's containerd reject; a documented skopeo-based emergency recovery procedure exists in CLAUDE.md if this ever recurs with buildpacks.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://CLAUDE.md#L171-L171",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d00c6f1a810a4782bf78ebb9e8cc7a40b3cefeb3f7fd2bd6369b7d44662cf4bb:"
