    {
      "id": "claim_05b179c5ea0644668337f5475b8b18cb",
      "statement": "The Helm chart's startupProbe (periodSeconds=5, failureThreshold=60, i.e. up to 5 minutes) gates the readinessProbe and livenessProbe on the myfeeder Deployment; all three probes hit /actuator/health on port 8080 and are tunable via values.yaml app.probes.{startup,readiness,liveness}.",
      "evidence": [
