    {
      "id": "claim_bcfcdc0b4db849a3bf9ba874fce0e9d3",
      "statement": "The Helm Deployment template hardcodes JDK_JAVA_OPTIONS=-XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=64M as a container env var; this superseded the old Paketo buildpack's hardcoded 10M direct-memory cap that had starved Netty/Lettuce (Redis client), and the current Dockerfile-based JRE image no longer needs an override but the chart still sets this env var for tuning.",
